From 9cef76c93e7fedcbd97d5c06d40a7664c42a5430 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:38:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] No Health Connect import in the first release

Google Play reviews every declared health permission with a form of
its own, so the first ALMOVA release leaves the import of readings from
Health Connect / Apple Health out: the manifest no longer declares its
permissions, queries, rationale filter and permission usage alias, the
settings hide its tile and the app does not start its sync.
HEALTH_CONNECT in consts.dart brings the Dart side back; the manifest
test checks it against the manifest in both states.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
---
 android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml      | 42 ++-----------------
 lib/core/consts.dart                          |  6 +++
 lib/core/home_tabs_screen.dart                |  5 ++-
 lib/features/account/widgets/settings.dart    |  3 +-
 .../account/widgets/settings_test.dart        |  8 ++++
 .../features/health/health_manifest_test.dart | 12 +++++-
 6 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)

